## Anatomy

```
┌ TaskRail ──┬ Transcript ───────────────┐
│            │                           │
│            ├ ActivityShelf ────────────┤
├────────────┴ WorkingState ─────────────┤
│ Mode ribbon + PromptComposer           │
├────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Status                                 │
└────────────────────────────────────────┘
        ┌ Permission / Plan / Diff / … ┐
        └──────────────────────────────┘
```

- Focus chrome: `PanelChrome::Focused` only on the pane that owns scene focus.
- Overlays are dismissible scene layers; **one-layer Esc**. Composer draft is never cleared by overlays.
- Densities: `Normal` (≥72) · `Narrow` (40–71) · `Tiny` (&lt;40).

## Minimal host loop

```rust
use termrock::patterns::{
    AgentWorkbenchState, WorkbenchSurfaces, default_modes,
    example_workbench_tasks, example_workbench_activities, render_agent_workbench,
};
use termrock::style::DesignSystem;
use termrock::widgets::{
    PermissionPrompt, PermissionPromptState, PromptComposer, PromptComposerState,
    Transcript, TranscriptState, /* … */
};

let system = DesignSystem::default();
let mut workbench = AgentWorkbenchState::new();
let mut prompt_state = PromptComposerState::new();
let mut permission_state = PermissionPromptState::new();
let tasks = example_workbench_tasks();
let activities = example_workbench_activities();

// each frame:
render_agent_workbench(buf, area, WorkbenchSurfaces {
    system: &system,
    state: &mut workbench,
    task_models: Some(&tasks),
    tasks: &[],
    modes: &default_modes("build"),
    transcript: &transcript,
    transcript_state: &mut tstate,
    activities: Some(&activities),
    prompt: &PromptComposer::new(&system),
    prompt_state: &mut prompt_state,
    status_slots: &slots,
    status_state: &mut sstate,
    permission: Some((&PermissionPrompt::new(&system), &mut permission_state)),
    question: None,
    plan: None,
    diff: None,
    session: None,
    working: None,
});

// keys — overlay first, then focused pane; draft never cleared
let _ = workbench.handle_key(
    key, &mut prompt_state, &mut tstate, &blocks,
    Some(&mut permission_state),
    Some(&tasks), None,
    Some(&activities), None,
);
```

## Laws

| Law | Detail |
|-----|--------|
| Draft | Overlays never clear `PromptComposerState` |
| Esc | One dismissible layer peels; no grant / submit |
| Focus | Tab cycles TaskRail → Transcript → Activity → Prompt |
| Public only | Pattern uses public widgets + layout/scene only |
| Host owns I/O | Outcomes are requests |

